    english: Answer Arya's call
    indonesian: Jawab telepon Bos Arya
  - key: quest.main.call.answer
    english: Press E to answer
    indonesian: Tekan E untuk menjawab
  - key: quest.main.boss_first
    english: Meet Arya in his office
    indonesian: Temui Bos Arya di ruangannya
  - key: quest.main.boss_first.talk
    english: Listen to Arya's request
    indonesian: Dengarkan permintaan Bos Arya
